TEXT -384 612 Left 2 ;MIC4427(=VA/VB, Rser=6ohm model) drives GATES of 2SK4017 push-pull -> CT 1:5 -> series L tune -> TD04A
TEXT -384 644 Left 2 ;NOTE: driving the transformer directly with MIC4427 outputs (as in design doc) does NOT work:
TEXT -384 676 Left 2 ;totem-pole outputs are never high-Z, so the off-side output clamps the winding (no flux swing),
TEXT -384 708 Left 2 ;and idle-LOW would put 12V DC across both halves (saturation). FET push-pull fixes both.
TEXT -384 740 Left 2 ;Protection: gate zener+pulldown, drain SMBJ33A TVS + RC snubber, V12 SMBJ15A + bulk.
TEXT -384 772 Left 2 ;Rdmp sets transducer drive level (TD04A max drive unknown -> confirm after C0/rating measurement).
